# PistKoordinat — elle deneme koleksiyonu (VS Code "REST Client" eklentisi)
# Önce dosyanın başındaki giriş isteklerini çalıştırın; tokenlar aşağıda otomatik kullanılır.
# Tarihler boş bırakıldığında API havalimanı saatine göre bugünü kullanır.

@api = http://localhost:8080
@pw = Demo.2026!

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- oturum

# @name ops
POST {{api}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "ops@pist.test", "password": "{{pw}}"}

###
# @name sef
POST {{api}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "sef@pist.test", "password": "{{pw}}"}

###
# @name ekip
POST {{api}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "ekip@pist.test", "password": "{{pw}}"}

###
# @name havayolu
POST {{api}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "havayolu@pist.test", "password": "{{pw}}"}

###
# @name yonetim
POST {{api}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "yonetim@pist.test", "password": "{{pw}}"}

###
@OPS = Bearer {{ops.response.body.access_token}}
@SEF = Bearer {{sef.response.body.access_token}}
@EKIP = Bearer {{ekip.response.body.access_token}}
@HAVAYOLU = Bearer {{havayolu.response.body.access_token}}
@YONETIM = Bearer {{yonetim.response.body.access_token}}

### Yanlış parola → 401 invalid_credentials
POST {{api}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "ops@pist.test", "password": "yanlis"}

### Refresh rotasyonu (aynı refresh token ikinci kez → 401 token_reused)
POST {{api}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{"refresh_token": "{{yonetim.response.body.refresh_token}}"}

### Oturumdaki kullanıcı
GET {{api}}/api/v1/me
Authorization: {{EKIP}}

### Sağlık, metrikler, OpenAPI
GET {{api}}/health

###
GET {{api}}/metrics

###
GET {{api}}/openapi.yaml

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- F-1 uçuşlar

GET {{api}}/api/v1/flights?limit=20&direction=ARR
Authorization: {{OPS}}

### Sonraki sayfa: önceki yanıttaki next_cursor değerini yapıştırın
GET {{api}}/api/v1/flights?limit=20&cursor=BURAYA
Authorization: {{OPS}}

### Havayolu temsilcisi yalnızca kendi uçuşlarını görür
GET {{api}}/api/v1/flights?limit=5
Authorization: {{HAVAYOLU}}

### Başka havayolu filtresi → 403
GET {{api}}/api/v1/flights?airline=MR
Authorization: {{HAVAYOLU}}

### Ekip lideri uçuş listesine erişemez → 403
GET {{api}}/api/v1/flights
Authorization: {{EKIP}}

### Uçuş detayı
GET {{api}}/api/v1/flights/1
Authorization: {{OPS}}

### Uçuş ekle (idempotent: aynı anahtarla tekrar → aynı yanıt, Idempotent-Replayed: true)
POST {{api}}/api/v1/flights
Authorization: {{OPS}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: elle-ucus-0001

{"flight_no": "PX4321", "direction": "ARR", "tail_number": "TC-PXA", "other_airport": "ESB", "sched_time": "2026-11-15T10:00:00+03:00"}

### Doğrulama hatası → 422
POST {{api}}/api/v1/flights
Authorization: {{OPS}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"flight_no": "kötü", "direction": "ARR", "tail_number": "TC-PXA", "other_airport": "ESB", "sched_time": "2026-11-15T10:00:00+03:00"}

### Turnaround kur (o günün eşlenmemiş uçuşları)
POST {{api}}/api/v1/schedule/build
Authorization: {{OPS}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"date": "2026-11-15"}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- F-2 envanter

GET {{api}}/api/v1/stands
Authorization: {{OPS}}

### Yalnızca B77W'ye uyumlu standlar
GET {{api}}/api/v1/stands?type=B77W
Authorization: {{OPS}}

###
GET {{api}}/api/v1/gates
Authorization: {{OPS}}

###
GET {{api}}/api/v1/aircraft-types
Authorization: {{OPS}}

### Stand kapat (denetim kaydına yazılır). Geri açmak için active: true
PATCH {{api}}/api/v1/stands/26
Authorization: {{OPS}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"active": false}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- F-3 / T-1 tahsis

GET {{api}}/api/v1/allocations
Authorization: {{OPS}}

### Günün tahsisini çöz (çözülemeyenler nedenleriyle döner)
POST {{api}}/api/v1/allocations/run
Authorization: {{OPS}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: tahsis-calistir-0001

{"date": "2026-10-30"}

###
GET {{api}}/api/v1/allocations/runs/latest
Authorization: {{SEF}}

### Elle atama; standı dolu bir zamana koymak → 409 conflict (EXCLUDE)
POST {{api}}/api/v1/allocations
Authorization: {{OPS}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"turnaround_id": 10, "stand_id": 1}

### Gantt verisi
GET {{api}}/api/v1/gantt
Authorization: {{HAVAYOLU}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- F-5 / T-2 besleme ve yeniden planlama

# Sırasız ve tekrarlı: seq 3, 1, 3 → APPLIED 1, STALE 1, DUPLICATE 1
# flight_no ve op_date'i GET /flights çıktısından alın.
POST {{api}}/api/v1/feed/events
Authorization: {{OPS}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"events": [
  {"source": "ELLE", "message_id": "m-3", "flight_no": "YK2911", "op_date": "2026-10-30", "direction": "DEP", "seq": 3, "kind": "ESTIMATE", "new_time": "2026-10-30T07:10:00+03:00"},
  {"source": "ELLE", "message_id": "m-1", "flight_no": "YK2911", "op_date": "2026-10-30", "direction": "DEP", "seq": 1, "kind": "ESTIMATE", "new_time": "2026-10-30T06:20:00+03:00"},
  {"source": "ELLE", "message_id": "m-3", "flight_no": "YK2911", "op_date": "2026-10-30", "direction": "DEP", "seq": 3, "kind": "ESTIMATE", "new_time": "2026-10-30T07:10:00+03:00"}
]}

### Plandan sapan uçuşlar
GET {{api}}/api/v1/replan/pending
Authorization: {{OPS}}

### Ne olur? (hiçbir şey yazılmaz)
# @name preview
POST {{api}}/api/v1/replan/preview
Authorization: {{OPS}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"flight_id": 50, "new_time": "2026-10-30T10:30:00+03:00"}

### Uygula (önizlemedeki parmak iziyle; arada durum değiştiyse 409 plan_changed)
POST {{api}}/api/v1/replan/apply
Authorization: {{OPS}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: replan-elle-0001

{"flight_id": 50, "new_time": "2026-10-30T10:30:00+03:00", "fingerprint": "{{preview.response.body.fingerprint}}"}

### Şef önizleyebilir ama uygulayamaz → 403
POST {{api}}/api/v1/replan/apply
Authorization: {{SEF}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"flight_id": 50, "new_time": "2026-10-30T10:30:00+03:00"}

### Son değişiklikler
GET {{api}}/api/v1/changes
Authorization: {{SEF}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- F-4 / T-3 ekipler

GET {{api}}/api/v1/crews
Authorization: {{SEF}}

###
GET {{api}}/api/v1/equipment
Authorization: {{SEF}}

###
GET {{api}}/api/v1/tasks?limit=50
Authorization: {{SEF}}

### Ekip ataması (riskler, dinlenme ihlalleri, atanamayanlar)
POST {{api}}/api/v1/assignments/run
Authorization: {{SEF}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: atama-0001

{"date": "2026-10-30"}

### Risk önizlemesi (salt okunur)
GET {{api}}/api/v1/risks
Authorization: {{OPS}}

### 11 saat dinlenme kuralını bozan vardiya → 422 rest_rule_violation (Temizlik-1 erken vardiyada)
POST {{api}}/api/v1/crews/25/shifts
Authorization: {{SEF}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"start": "2026-10-30T20:00:00+03:00", "end": "2026-10-31T02:00:00+03:00"}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- F-6 / T-4 pano, akış, mobil

GET {{api}}/api/v1/dashboard
Authorization: {{YONETIM}}

### SSE akışı (REST Client akışı açık tutar; tarayıcıda: /api/v1/stream?access_token=...)
GET {{api}}/api/v1/stream
Authorization: {{YONETIM}}
Accept: text/event-stream

### Duyuru yayınla (akışa düşer)
POST {{api}}/api/v1/notices
Authorization: {{OPS}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"message": "Pist 05 bakım nedeniyle 14:00-14:30 kapalı", "level": "warning"}

### Ekip liderinin görevleri
GET {{api}}/api/v1/my/tasks
Authorization: {{EKIP}}

### Çevrimdışı biriken olaylar (ters sırada). task_id'yi /my/tasks çıktısından alın.
POST {{api}}/api/v1/sync/task-events
Authorization: {{EKIP}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"device_id": "tablet-elle", "events": [
  {"client_event_id": "11111111-1111-4111-8111-000000000002", "task_id": 10, "type": "FINISHED", "occurred_at": "{{$datetime iso8601 -10 m}}"},
  {"client_event_id": "11111111-1111-4111-8111-000000000001", "task_id": 10, "type": "STARTED", "occurred_at": "{{$datetime iso8601 -40 m}}"}
]}

### Aynı görevi şef daha erken "başladı" olarak bildiriyor → en erken başlangıç kazanır
POST {{api}}/api/v1/sync/task-events
Authorization: {{SEF}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"device_id": "sef-tablet", "events": [
  {"client_event_id": "11111111-1111-4111-8111-000000000003", "task_id": 10, "type": "STARTED", "occurred_at": "{{$datetime iso8601 -45 m}}"}
]}

### Görevin olay geçmişi
GET {{api}}/api/v1/tasks/10/events
Authorization: {{EKIP}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- F-7 / T-5 raporlar

GET {{api}}/api/v1/reports/turnaround?group_by=type
Authorization: {{YONETIM}}

###
GET {{api}}/api/v1/reports/turnaround?group_by=airline&from=2026-01-01&to=2026-10-30
Authorization: {{OPS}}

###
GET {{api}}/api/v1/reports/turnaround?group_by=stand
Authorization: {{YONETIM}}

### Materialized view'ı yenile
POST {{api}}/api/v1/reports/refresh
Authorization: {{YONETIM}}

###
GET {{api}}/api/v1/reports/data-quality
Authorization: {{YONETIM}}

### Denetim kaydı (yalnızca yönetim)
GET {{api}}/api/v1/audit
Authorization: {{YONETIM}}

### Operasyon kontrolörü denetim kaydını göremez → 403
GET {{api}}/api/v1/audit
Authorization: {{OPS}}
